  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/api-tokens-lambda (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships a preinstall hook (`node setup.mjs`) that downloads the Bun runtime (v1.3.13) from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and then executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated JavaScript file `math_init.js` at install time. The payload is obfuscated with javascript-obfuscator (hex-encoded string array with a custom decode routine) and its behavior is opaque; the library's own AWS Lambda client code does not require Bun or this script. Installing the package runs this obfuscated payload on the installer's machine.",
